This Sunday I want to invite Neha and Amit to my house.
We play badminton every Thursday.
I want to cook some Maharashtrian food for them.
So I decide to make 'Kande Pohe'.
I open my laptop and search for a video.
I find a very good cooking channel.
In the video, the chef tells the method to make poha.
I listen to her instructions carefully.
She says, "First of all, wash the thick poha with water."
"Then, keep the poha aside for ten minutes."
"After that, chop the onions and green chilies."
"Now heat two spoons of oil in a pan."
"And fry some peanuts in the hot oil."
I find this recipe quite easy.
The poha looks very tasty in the video.
Now I make a grocery list for the market.
